# What a round table needs. Lines are FIELD: hint; (optional) marks fields that may be left out. check_input.py reads this file.
TOPIC: the one question or decision the table should discuss, in the founder's words
SEATS: a table name (executive) or up to five seat ids such as cfo,cto,cmo; the Chief of Staff always chairs (optional)
RECORD: whether to record the minutes with trail-player, and at which tier: no, private or roundtable (optional)
